Package: pixel-downloader
Version: 1.0.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, ffmpeg
Maintainer: Emmanuel M. Mwangata <emmanuel@pixelgalaxylab.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/Emmanuel17A/pixel-downloader
Description: Pixel Downloader - Fast Download Manager
 A powerful IDM-like download manager for Linux built by Pixel & Galaxy Lab.
 Features multi-threaded chunk downloading, video extraction from 1000+ sites,
 browser extension integration, and a native GTK4 interface.
